{"rsid":2643,"house":"Rajya Sabha","name":"Shri Paka Venkata Satyanarayana","reviewed_at":"2026-10-29T22:19:46.654Z","sections":{"questions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/Question/GetMeber_Question?mpcode=2643","status":"available","total":2,"source_total":2,"records":[{"mp_code":2643,"qslno":319219,"qtitle":"Foreign exchange earnings from export of marine products","qtype":"STARRED   ","ans_date":"12.12.2025","adate":"2025-12-12T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":146,"name":"Paka Venkata Satyanarayana              ","min_name":"COMMERCE AND INDUSTRY  ","qn_text":"(a) the net foreign exchange earnings generated from export of marine products, specifically prawns and shrimps, during last three financial years, and year-on-year growth rate recorded; \r\n(b) specific export promotion schemes or incentives currently being provided to prawn farmers and Farmer Producer Organisations (FPOs) to enhance global competitiveness and quality assurance of Indian shrimp exports; \r\n(c) average per capita income increase recorded for registered prawn farmers since the launch of major Government schemes promoting aquaculture exports; and\r\n(d) whether Government plans to reduce import duties on critical inputs like high quality broodstock and feed to lower the production cost for farmers?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":269,"depc":9,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/269/AS146_qQt3KP.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/269/AS146_qQt3KP.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AS146_qQt3KP.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AS146_qQt3KP.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/269/AS146_qQt3KP.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/269/AS146_qQt3KP.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2643,"qslno":318984,"qtitle":"Supply of domestically produced prawns under PMMSY","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"10.12.2025","adate":"2025-12-10T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":1181,"name":"Paka Venkata Satyanarayana              ","min_name":"FISHERIES, ANIMAL HUSBANDRY AND DAIRYING","qn_text":"(a) whether Government has initiated any specific programme or policy under the Pradhan Mantri Matsya Sampada Yojana (PMMSY) to facilitate the supply of domestically produced prawns to Defence establishments, Ministry of Home Affairs’ forces and educational hostels (SC/ST) for nutritional security;\r\n(b) if so, the details of the pilot projects undertaken and the quantity of prawns supplied to these institutions in the last three financial years;\r\n(c) the budgetary allocation earmarked for strengthening the domestic supply chain and quality assurance systems specifically for this purpose; and\r\n(d) whether the Ministry plans to introduce mandatory procurement quota for domestic seafood, including prawns, for large-scale institutional consumption?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":269,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/269/AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/269/AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/269/AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/269/AU1181_oVu8OE.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null}]},"special_mentions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGetdata/Get_SpecialMentionmemberwise?mpcode=2643","status":"available","total":1,"source_total":1,"records":[{"mp_code":2643,"mp_name":"Shri                Paka Venkata                                                Satyanarayana                                               ","sr_no":24,"subject":"Demand to boost domestic consumption of Aquaculture products. ","sess_no":269,"SM_Text":"<p><p class=MsoNormal style=margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-1.0in;line-height:normal><b><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>Shri Paka Venkata Satyanarayana:</span></b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? </span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? I draw the attention of the?\r\nGovernment to the urgent need to support the Aquaculture and Pisciculture\r\nsector, which is vital for our journey towards a Viksit Bharat. As we strive\r\nfor Atmanirbhar Bharat, we must apply the mantra of Vocal for Local to\r\nprotect our fish and prawn farmers.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? India is a global leader in\r\nthis sector, exporting nearly 75% of its produce to international markets. It\r\nis a matter of pride that Andhra Pradesh alone contributes nearly 70% of these\r\nexports. However, this sector is currently facing a severe crisis due to the\r\nvolatile international market, specifically the imposition of Anti-Dumping\r\nDuties by the USA. This has severely impacted the livelihood of our farmers.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? To counter this, we must\r\n&quot;vibrate&quot; and boost domestic consumption within the nation. Fish and\r\nprawns are rich in protein and essential for good health. Therefore, I urge the\r\nGovernment to introduce a policy to include these nutrient-rich products in the\r\ndietary supplies of the Defence Sector, including the Armed Forces, CRPF, CISF\r\netc., as well as in canteens of Public Sector Undertakings.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? Furthermore, to combat\r\nmalnutrition and ensure a healthy future generation, I request the Government\r\nto include fish products in Mid-Day Meal schemes, Anganwadis, and SC/ST/OBC\r\nResidential Schools run by State and Central Governments.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? This initiative will cut out\r\nthe reliance on freight-heavy exports, solve the market crisis for Andhra\r\nfarmers, and provide high-quality nutrition to our soldiers and children.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>??????????? I urge the Government to look\r\ninto it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=right style=margin-bottom:0in;text-align:right;\r\nline-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif>(ENDS)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style=margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-1.0in;line-height:normal><span lang=EN-US style=font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif></p>","Admis_Sno":0,"Made":"y","made_Date":"03/12/2025","Ministry":"Fisheries, Animal Husbandry and Dairying","dt_iss":null,"proposed_dt":null,"MIN_NO":"99","Permitted":"y","Date_Permission":"-         ","sno_made":24,"dt_final":null,"reply":"No Reply","made_date_compare":"2025-12-03T00:00:00"}]},"committees":{"source":"https://integration.rajyasabha.digital/committee-integration/api/v1/web/mp/Get_Committee_DetailMemberwise?mpcode=2643","status":"available","total":2,"source_total":2,"records":[{"memname":"Paka Venkata Satyanarayana","comname":"Committee on the Welfare of Other Backward Classes","comm_code":45,"comm_code_old":"45","frmdate":"2026-09-24 00:00:00","date":"24/09/2026","type":"Member","house":"Rajya Sabha"},{"memname":"Paka Venkata Satyanarayana","comname":"Science and Technology, Environment, Forests and Climate Change","comm_code":19,"comm_code_old":"19","frmdate":"2026-09-26 00:00:00","date":"26/09/2026","type":"Member","house":"Rajya Sabha"}]},"attendance_sessions":{"source":"https://sansad.in/api_rs/member/attendance/sessions?mpCode=2643","status":"available","total":4,"source_total":4,"records":[{"id":3423,"startDate":"2026-07-20 00:00:00.0","endDate":"2026-08-13 00:00:00.0","sessionNo":271,"description":"MonsoonSession"},{"id":3422,"startDate":"2026-01-28 00:00:00.0","endDate":"2026-04-18 00:00:00.0","sessionNo":270,"description":"BudgetSession"},{"id":3421,"startDate":"2025-12-01 00:00:00.0","endDate":"2025-12-19 00:00:00.0","sessionNo":269,"description":"WinterSession"},{"id":3420,"startDate":"2025-07-21 00:00:00.0","endDate":"2025-08-21 00:00:00.0","sessionNo":268,"description":"MonsoonSession"}]},"tours":{"source":"https://sansad.in/api_poi/cons-connect/mp-tour/my-tours?mpCode=2643&house=RS&page=1&size=500","status":"available","total":0,"source_total":0,"records":[]},"bills":{"source":"https://sansad.in/api_rs/legislation/getBills?mpCode=2643&billName=&house=&ministryName=&billType=Private%20Member&billCategory=&billStatus=&introductionDateFrom=&introductionDateTo=&passedInLsDateFrom=&passedInLsDateTo=&passedInRsDateFrom=&passedInRsDateTo=&page=1&size=500&locale=en&sortOn=billIntroducedDate&sortBy=desc","status":"available","total":0,"source_total":0,"records":[]},"assurances":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGetdata/GetCGA?mpcode=2643","status":"available","total":0,"source_total":0,"records":[]}